#: conf.json:summary
msgid "Algebraic traits and default numeric instances that define the generic foundation for LunaFlow math packages."
msgstr "代数 trait 与默认数值实例，构成 LunaFlow 数学包的泛型基础。"

#: manual/api/core.md:1
msgid "core API"
msgstr "core API"

#: manual/api/core.md:3
#: manual/api/hom.md:3
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "作用"

#: manual/api/core.md:5
msgid "`luna-generic` is the algebraic trait layer of LunaFlow. It does not provide numerical algorithms or containers by itself; it defines the reusable capability surface that higher-level packages depend on."
msgstr "`luna-generic` 是 LunaFlow 的代数 trait 基础层。它本身不提供数值算法或容器，而是给上层包提供共享的能力边界。"

#: manual/api/core.md:9
msgid "Structural traits"
msgstr "结构 traits"

#: manual/api/core.md:18
#: manual/index.md:23
msgid "Deprecated: `NatHomomorphism`, `IntegralHomomorphism`"
msgstr "已废弃：`NatHomomorphism`、`IntegralHomomorphism`"

#: manual/api/core.md:20
msgid "These traits live in `src/structure.mbt`."
msgstr "这些定义在 `src/structure.mbt` 中。"

#: manual/api/core.md:22
msgid "Operational traits"
msgstr "操作 traits"

#: manual/api/core.md:29
msgid "These traits live in `src/operation.mbt`."
msgstr "这些定义在 `src/operation.mbt` 中。"

#: manual/api/core.md:31
msgid "Shipped instances"
msgstr "内置实例"

#: manual/api/core.md:33
msgid "Signed integers: `Int`, `Int16`, `Int64`"
msgstr "有符号整数：`Int`、`Int16`、`Int64`"

#: manual/api/core.md:34
msgid "Unsigned integers: `UInt`, `UInt16`, `UInt64`"
msgstr "无符号整数：`UInt`、`UInt16`、`UInt64`"

#: manual/api/core.md:35
msgid "Exact big integer: `BigInt`"
msgstr "精确大整数：`BigInt`"

#: manual/api/core.md:36
msgid "Floating instances: `Float`, `Double`"
msgstr "浮点实例：`Float`、`Double`"

#: manual/api/core.md:38
#: manual/index.md:38
msgid "Conversions"
msgstr "转换"

#: manual/api/core.md:40
msgid "`FromNat::from_natural(BigInt) -> Self`: the unique semiring homomorphism ℕ -> `Self`. The argument must be non-negative."
msgstr "`FromNat::from_natural(BigInt) -> Self`：唯一的半环同态 ℕ -> `Self`。参数必须非负。"

#: manual/api/core.md:42
msgid "`FromInteger::from_integer(BigInt) -> Self`: the unique ring homomorphism ℤ -> `Self`; it agrees with `from_natural` on non-negative arguments."
msgstr "`FromInteger::from_integer(BigInt) -> Self`：唯一的环同态 ℤ -> `Self`；在非负参数上与 `from_natural` 一致。"

#: manual/api/core.md:44
msgid "`Integral::normalize(Self) -> BigInt`: the representative of a value. `Integral` extends `Semiring + FromInteger`, and the law is `Self::from_integer(normalize(x)) == x`."
msgstr "`Integral::normalize(Self) -> BigInt`：一个值的代表元。`Integral` 扩展 `Semiring + FromInteger`，定律为 `Self::from_integer(normalize(x)) == x`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:47
msgid "`lift_to(x) -> R` for `x : S` with `S : Integral` and `R : FromInteger`: `R::from_integer(x.normalize())`. It is a function, not a homomorphism."
msgstr "`lift_to(x) -> R`，其中 `x : S`，`S : Integral`，`R : FromInteger`：即 `R::from_integer(x.normalize())`。它是一个函数，不是同态。"

#: manual/api/core.md:49
msgid "Deprecated: `NatHomomorphism::from_nat` and `IntegralHomomorphism::from_integral` compose `normalize` with a target conversion. Implement `FromNat` / `FromInteger` and call `lift_to` instead."
msgstr "已废弃：`NatHomomorphism::from_nat` 与 `IntegralHomomorphism::from_integral` 把 `normalize` 与目标侧转换复合在一起。请改为实现 `FromNat` / `FromInteger` 并调用 `lift_to`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:53
#: manual/api/hom.md:129
msgid "Semantic notes"
msgstr "语义说明"

#: manual/api/core.md:55
msgid "Fixed-width integers are ℤ/2^k. Their `from_integer` reduces modulo 2^k, and `normalize` picks the representative in the type's range: `[-2^(k-1), 2^(k-1))` for signed types, `[0, 2^k)` for unsigned ones."
msgstr "定宽整数是 ℤ/2^k。它们的 `from_integer` 按模 2^k 约化，`normalize` 选取类型范围内的代表元：有符号类型为 `[-2^(k-1), 2^(k-1))`，无符号类型为 `[0, 2^k)`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:58
msgid "`BigInt` is ℤ itself: `from_integer` and `normalize` are the identity."
msgstr "`BigInt` 就是 ℤ 本身：`from_integer` 与 `normalize` 都是恒等映射。"

#: manual/api/core.md:59
msgid "`lift_to` is a homomorphism exactly when the target modulus divides the source modulus, as for `Int64 -> Int`. Into `BigInt`, `Float` or `Double` it is not one for fixed-width sources, because their arithmetic wraps."
msgstr "`lift_to` 当且仅当目标模数整除源模数时是同态，例如 `Int64 -> Int`。对定宽源而言，映到 `BigInt`、`Float` 或 `Double` 都不是同态，因为源侧运算会回绕。"

#: manual/api/core.md:62
msgid "`Nat` covers the integral types whose representatives are non-negative. A true arbitrary-precision ℕ is not a quotient of ℤ and is out of scope."
msgstr "`Nat` 涵盖代表元非负的整数类型。真正的任意精度 ℕ 不是 ℤ 的商，不在本包范围内。"

#: manual/api/core.md:64
msgid "Unsigned integer instances stop at `Semiring`; they do not pretend to be additive groups or rings."
msgstr "无符号整数实例止步于 `Semiring`，不会伪装成带加法逆元的结构。"

#: manual/api/core.md:66
msgid "`Float` and `Double` round in `from_natural` and `from_integer`, so very large values are approximate."
msgstr "`Float` 与 `Double` 在 `from_natural` 和 `from_integer` 中会舍入，因此非常大的值是近似的。"

#: manual/api/core.md:69
msgid "Source map"
msgstr "源码入口"

#: manual/api/core.md:71
msgid "`src/structure.mbt`: trait definitions"
msgstr "`src/structure.mbt`：trait 定义"

#: manual/api/core.md:72
msgid "`src/operation.mbt`: operational traits"
msgstr "`src/operation.mbt`：基础操作 traits"

#: manual/api/core.md:73
msgid "`src/impl_signed.mbt`, `src/impl_unsigned.mbt`, `src/impl_bigint.mbt`, `src/impl_float.mbt`, `src/impl_dbl.mbt`: default instances"
msgstr "`src/impl_signed.mbt`、`src/impl_unsigned.mbt`、`src/impl_bigint.mbt`、 `src/impl_float.mbt`、`src/impl_dbl.mbt`：默认实例"

#: manual/api/hom.md:1
msgid "hom API"
msgstr "hom API"

#: manual/api/hom.md:5
msgid "The `hom` subsystem provides generalized homomorphisms. A `Hom[S, A, B]` is a map `A -> B` that carries a certificate stating it preserves every operation of the signature `S`. A `Section[S, Q, A]` certifies a lift that picks one representative per class of a quotient. Neither certificate can be forged outside this package. The unproven leaves are `Hom::postulate`, `Section::postulate`, and the canonical `Hom::from_integer` and `Section::of_integral`, whose obligation sits on trait instances."
msgstr "`hom` 子系统提供广义同态：一个 `Hom[S, A, B]` 是一个映射 `A -> B`，并带有“保持签名 `S` 中所有运算”的证书。`Section[S, Q, A]` 证明一个提升从商的每个类中恰好选出一个代表元。两种证书在本包外都无法伪造。未经证明的叶子是 `Hom::postulate`、`Section::postulate`，以及典范的 `Hom::from_integer` 与 `Section::of_integral`，后两者的义务落在 trait 实例上。"

#: manual/api/hom.md:13
msgid "Source: `src/hom.mbt`, `src/section.mbt`."
msgstr "源码：`src/hom.mbt`、`src/section.mbt`。"

#: manual/api/hom.md:15
msgid "Signature tags"
msgstr "签名标签"

#: manual/api/hom.md:23
msgid "Signature tags are empty enums that only appear at the type level. Users may define their own."
msgstr "签名标签是空枚举，只在类型层出现。用户可以定义自己的标签。"

#: manual/api/hom.md:26
msgid "Algebra dictionaries"
msgstr "代数字典"

#: manual/api/hom.md:28
msgid "`Op[A]`: one operation with `name`, `arity` and `eval`. `arity == 0` is a constant."
msgstr "`Op[A]`：一个运算，包含 `name`、`arity`、`eval`。`arity == 0` 表示常量。"

#: manual/api/hom.md:29
msgid "`Algebra[S, A]`: an interpretation of the signature `S` on the carrier `A`."
msgstr "`Algebra[S, A]`：签名 `S` 在载体 `A` 上的一种解释。"

#: manual/api/hom.md:30
msgid "`Algebra::add_monoid`, `mul_monoid`, `add_group`, `semiring`, `ring`: derived from the existing structure trait instances."
msgstr "`Algebra::add_monoid`、`mul_monoid`、`add_group`、`semiring`、`ring`：从现有结构 trait 实例派生。"

#: manual/api/hom.md:32
msgid "`Algebra::make(ops)`: builds a dictionary for a custom signature tag."
msgstr "`Algebra::make(ops)`：为自定义签名标签构造字典。"

#: manual/api/hom.md:33
msgid "`Algebra::prod(a, b)`: the componentwise product algebra on `Prod[A, B]`."
msgstr "`Algebra::prod(a, b)`：逐分量的积代数，载体为 `Prod[A, B]`。"

#: manual/api/hom.md:35
msgid "Two dictionaries of the same `S` must list the same operations (name and arity) in the same order; otherwise `Algebra::prod` and `Hom::check_by` abort."
msgstr "同一个 `S` 的两个字典必须按相同顺序列出相同的运算（名字与元数一致），否则 `Algebra::prod` 与 `Hom::check_by` 会 abort。"

#: manual/api/hom.md:38
msgid "Certificates assume one `S`-algebra per carrier: every dictionary of the same `S` on the same carrier must interpret the operations the same way. `then` composes through the middle carrier, so two different `Algebra::make` dictionaries on it would compose into a map that preserves neither."
msgstr "证书假定每个载体上只有一个 `S`-代数：同一载体上、同一 `S` 的所有字典必须以相同方式解释运算。`then` 经由中间载体复合，因此若中间载体上有两个不同的 `Algebra::make` 字典，复合得到的映射对哪一个都不保持。"

#: manual/api/hom.md:43
msgid "Product type"
msgstr "积类型"

#: manual/api/hom.md:45
msgid "`Prod[A, B]`: fields `fst` and `snd`. Implements `Add`, `Mul`, `Neg`, `Sub`, `Zero` and `One`, and `AddMonoid`, `MulMonoid`, `AddGroup`, `Semiring` and `Ring` whenever both components do."
msgstr "`Prod[A, B]`：字段 `fst`、`snd`。实现了 `Add`、`Mul`、`Neg`、`Sub`、`Zero`、`One`，并在分量满足时实现 `AddMonoid`、`MulMonoid`、`AddGroup`、`Semiring`、`Ring`。"

#: manual/api/hom.md:49
msgid "Homomorphisms"
msgstr "同态"

#: manual/api/hom.md:51
msgid "Trust entry (creates a proof obligation):"
msgstr "信任入口（产生证明义务）："

#: manual/api/hom.md:53
msgid "`Hom::postulate(f)`: the caller promises that for every operation `op` of `S` and all arguments `xs`, `f(op_A(xs)) == op_B(xs.map(f))`. The promise is always strict equality, even when the map is only checked with a lax or tolerance relation."
msgstr "`Hom::postulate(f)`：调用者承诺，对 `S` 的每个运算 `op` 和所有参数 `xs`，`f(op_A(xs)) == op_B(xs.map(f))`。即使该映射只用松弛关系或容差关系检验，这一承诺也始终是严格相等。"

#: manual/api/hom.md:58
msgid "Inference rules (no new obligation):"
msgstr "推理规则（不产生新义务）："

#: manual/api/hom.md:60
msgid "`Hom::id()`, `h.then(g)`: identity and composition."
msgstr "`Hom::id()`、`h.then(g)`：恒等与复合。"

#: manual/api/hom.md:61
msgid "`h.forget(r)`: forgets structure along a `Reduct[S, T]` witness."
msgstr "`h.forget(r)`：沿约化见证 `Reduct[S, T]` 遗忘结构。"

#: manual/api/hom.md:62
msgid "`Hom::pair(f, g)`, `Hom::fst()`, `Hom::snd()`: pairing and projections."
msgstr "`Hom::pair(f, g)`、`Hom::fst()`、`Hom::snd()`：积的配对与投影。"

#: manual/api/hom.md:63
msgid "`h.to_add_group()`: an additive monoid hom between groups preserves `neg`."
msgstr "`h.to_add_group()`：群之间的加法幺半群同态自动保持 `neg`。"

#: manual/api/hom.md:64
msgid "`h.to_ring()`: a semiring hom between rings preserves `neg`."
msgstr "`h.to_ring()`：环之间的半环同态自动保持 `neg`。"

#: manual/api/hom.md:66
msgid "Canonical map (the obligation sits on the trait instance):"
msgstr "典范映射（义务落在 trait 实例上）："

#: manual/api/hom.md:68
msgid "`Hom::from_integer()`: the canonical map ℤ -> `R` of `FromInteger`, typed `Hom[SemiringSig, BigInt, R]`. It holds on every input; upgrade with `to_ring` when `R` is a ring."
msgstr "`Hom::from_integer()`：`FromInteger` 给出的典范映射 ℤ -> `R`，类型为 `Hom[SemiringSig, BigInt, R]`。它对所有输入成立；`R` 是环时用 `to_ring` 升级。"

#: manual/api/hom.md:71
msgid "Deprecated: `Hom::from_nat()` and `Hom::from_integral()` certify a lift followed by a canonical map, which is not a homomorphism for fixed-width sources. Use `Hom::from_integer` with `Section::of_integral`."
msgstr "已废弃：`Hom::from_nat()` 与 `Hom::from_integral()` 为“提升后接典范映射”发放证书，而这对定宽源不是同态。请改用 `Hom::from_integer` 配合 `Section::of_integral`。"

#: manual/api/hom.md:75
msgid "Use:"
msgstr "使用："

#: manual/api/hom.md:79
#: manual/design/hom.md:39
msgid "Sections"
msgstr "截面"

#: manual/api/hom.md:81
msgid "A section lifts a quotient `Q` back into `A` along a homomorphism `proj : A -> Q`, with `proj(lift(q)) == q`. The lift is not a homomorphism, but it preserves every operation up to the kernel of `proj`, and exactly whenever the result is itself a representative."
msgstr "截面沿同态 `proj : A -> Q` 把商 `Q` 提升回 `A`，满足 `proj(lift(q)) == q`。提升本身不是同态，但它在 `proj` 的核的意义下保持每个运算，并且当结果本身是代表元时严格保持。"

#: manual/api/hom.md:86
msgid "`Section::postulate(proj, lift)`: the caller promises `proj.apply(lift(q)) == q` for every `q`."
msgstr "`Section::postulate(proj, lift)`：调用者承诺对每个 `q` 都有 `proj.apply(lift(q)) == q`。"

#: manual/api/hom.md:88
msgid "`Section::of_integral()`: the canonical section of an integral type, `Section[SemiringSig, Z, BigInt]`, with `proj = FromInteger::from_integer` and `lift = Integral::normalize`."
msgstr "`Section::of_integral()`：整数类型的典范截面 `Section[SemiringSig, Z, BigInt]`，其中 `proj = FromInteger::from_integer`，`lift = Integral::normalize`。"

#: manual/api/hom.md:92
msgid "`s.normalize(a)`: `lift(proj(a))`, the normal form of `a`. Two values are congruent exactly when their normal forms are equal."
msgstr "`s.normalize(a)`：`lift(proj(a))`，即 `a` 的范式。两个值同余当且仅当它们的范式相等。"

#: manual/api/hom.md:94
msgid "`s.is_representative(a)`: `normalize(a) == a`; on such results the lift agrees with the operations."
msgstr "`s.is_representative(a)`：`normalize(a) == a`；在这样的结果上，提升与运算一致。"

#: manual/api/hom.md:96
msgid "`s.then(next)`, `s.forget(r)`, `s.to_add_group()`, `s.to_ring()`: inference rules, no new obligation."
msgstr "`s.then(next)`、`s.forget(r)`、`s.to_add_group()`、`s.to_ring()`：推理规则，不产生新的义务。"

#: manual/api/hom.md:98
msgid "`s.check(samples)`: tests the section law."
msgstr "`s.check(samples)`：检验截面律。"

#: manual/api/hom.md:99
msgid "`s.check_ops(quotient, cover, samples)`: tests `proj(op_A(xs.map(lift))) == op_Q(xs)` for every operation."
msgstr "`s.check_ops(quotient, cover, samples)`：对每个运算检验 `proj(op_A(xs.map(lift))) == op_Q(xs)`。"

#: manual/api/hom.md:102
msgid "The section law rejects lifts that leave the class of their argument. It does not choose among representatives: `[0, 2^32)` and `[-2^31, 2^31)` are both sections of `BigInt -> Int`, and only the second preserves the signed order."
msgstr "截面律会拒绝离开参数所在类的提升，但不规定选哪个代表元：`[0, 2^32)` 与 `[-2^31, 2^31)` 都是 `BigInt -> Int` 的截面，只有后者保持有符号序。"

#: manual/api/hom.md:107
msgid "`lift_to(x)` lifts an integral value and maps it into any `FromInteger` target without a certificate."
msgstr "`lift_to(x)` 把整数值提升后映入任意 `FromInteger` 目标，不发放证书。"

#: manual/api/hom.md:110
msgid "Reduct witnesses"
msgstr "约化见证"

#: manual/api/hom.md:117
msgid "Only this package constructs `Reduct` values."
msgstr "`Reduct` 只能由本包构造。"

#: manual/api/hom.md:119
msgid "Law checks"
msgstr "定律检查"

#: manual/api/hom.md:121
msgid "`h.check(src, dst, samples)`: checks the law with exact equality; requires `B : Eq`."
msgstr "`h.check(src, dst, samples)`：以精确相等检查同态律，要求 `B : Eq`。"

#: manual/api/hom.md:122
msgid "`h.check_by(src, dst, samples, rel)`: checks `rel(f(op_A(xs)), op_B(f(xs)))`. `rel` sets the strength of preservation: equality for strict homomorphisms, `<=` for lax ones such as subadditive maps, and a tolerance for approximate homomorphisms into floating-point targets."
msgstr "`h.check_by(src, dst, samples, rel)`：以关系 `rel(f(op_A(xs)), op_B(f(xs)))` 检查。`rel` 决定保持的强度：相等对应严格同态，`<=` 对应 lax 同态（如次可加映射），带容差的比较对应浮点目标上的近似同态。"

#: manual/api/hom.md:127
msgid "An operation of arity `n` is tested on `samples.length()^n` tuples."
msgstr "元数为 `n` 的运算会在 `samples.length()^n` 个元组上测试。"

#: manual/api/hom.md:131
msgid "Fixed-width integer sources (`Int`, `Int64`, `UInt`, ...) are ℤ/2^k rather than the integers. There is no semiring map from them into `BigInt`, so a lift into ℤ is a section, not a homomorphism. The same argument rules out widening such as `Int -> Int64`, while truncation such as `Int64 -> Int` is a ring homomorphism."
msgstr "定宽整数源类型（`Int`、`Int64`、`UInt` 等）是 ℤ/2^k，而不是整数环。从它们到 `BigInt` 不存在半环同态，因此提升到 ℤ 是截面而不是同态。同样的论证排除了 `Int -> Int64` 这类拓宽，而 `Int64 -> Int` 这类截断是环同态。"

#: manual/api/hom.md:136
msgid "The inference rules compose certificates as strict homomorphisms. A map that only satisfies a lax (`<=`) or tolerance law must be checked again after composition."
msgstr "推理规则按严格同态来复合证书。只满足松弛（`<=`）或容差定律的映射，复合之后必须重新检验。"

#: manual/api/hom.md:139
msgid "`Float` and `Double` targets satisfy the laws only up to rounding; use `check_by` with a tolerance. See the embedding notes in the [core API](core.md)."
msgstr "`Float` 与 `Double` 目标只在舍入误差内满足同态律，应使用 `check_by` 加容差。参见 [core API](core.md) 的嵌入说明。"

#: manual/design/core.md:1
msgid "core design"
msgstr "core 设计"

#: manual/design/core.md:3
msgid "Design goal"
msgstr "设计目标"

#: manual/design/core.md:5
msgid "`luna-generic` gives LunaFlow a shared algebraic vocabulary. Packages such as `arithmetic`, `luna-complex`, `linear-algebra`, and `luna-poly` should be able to describe their requirements in terms of reusable traits instead of inventing their own incompatible capability layers."
msgstr "`luna-generic` 要给整个 LunaFlow 提供一套共享的代数词汇，让 `arithmetic`、`luna-complex`、`linear-algebra`、`luna-poly` 等包能够复用同一组能力边界。"

#: manual/design/core.md:10
msgid "Main design decisions"
msgstr "核心设计决策"

#: manual/design/core.md:12
msgid "The trait graph is layered and intentionally small."
msgstr "trait 图保持分层且足够小。"

#: manual/design/core.md:13
msgid "Structural traits such as `Ring`, `Field`, `Integral`, and `Nat` are kept separate from operational traits such as `Zero`, `One`, `Inverse`, and `Conjugate`."
msgstr "`Ring`、`Field`、`Integral`、`Nat` 这类结构 traits 与 `Zero`、`One`、 `Inverse`、`Conjugate` 这类操作 traits 分离。"

#: manual/design/core.md:16
msgid "Conversions are split into two halves that meet at ℤ, represented by `BigInt`. The target side is the canonical map ℤ -> `R` (`FromInteger`), which is unique and always a homomorphism. The source side is `Integral::normalize`, which picks a representative and is a homomorphism only for ℤ itself. `lift_to` composes them and promises nothing about operations."
msgstr "转换被拆成在 ℤ（以 `BigInt` 表示）处汇合的两半。目标侧是典范映射 ℤ -> `R`（`FromInteger`），它唯一且总是同态。源侧是 `Integral::normalize`，它选取代表元，只有对 ℤ 本身才是同态。`lift_to` 把两者复合，不对运算作任何承诺。"

#: manual/design/core.md:22
msgid "The halves are single-parameter traits because every conversion factors through ℤ, the initial ring: no trait has to relate two types."
msgstr "两半都是单参数 trait，因为每个转换都经由初始环 ℤ 分解：没有哪个 trait 需要关联两个类型。"

#: manual/design/core.md:24
msgid "`Integral` extends `FromInteger` with the law `from_integer(normalize(x)) == x`, which makes an integral type a quotient of ℤ with chosen representatives. `FromInteger` takes a `BigInt` rather than a generic integral source, so the traits do not refer to each other."
msgstr "`Integral` 以定律 `from_integer(normalize(x)) == x` 扩展 `FromInteger`，这使整数类型成为带有选定代表元的 ℤ 的商。`FromInteger` 接收 `BigInt` 而不是泛型的整数源，因此这些 trait 不会互相引用。"

#: manual/design/core.md:28
msgid "Unsigned types stop before additive inverse, so the abstraction stays mathematically honest."
msgstr "无符号类型不提供加法逆元，保证抽象在数学上保持诚实。"

#: manual/design/core.md:31
msgid "Integers as quotients of ℤ"
msgstr "作为 ℤ 的商的整数"

#: manual/design/core.md:33
msgid "This section gives the mathematics behind `FromNat`, `FromInteger`, `Integral` and `lift_to`. The [core tutorial](../tutorial/core.md) shows how to use them without it."
msgstr "本节给出 `FromNat`、`FromInteger`、`Integral` 与 `lift_to` 背后的数学。[core 教程](../tutorial/core.md)演示了不依赖这些数学的用法。"

#: manual/design/core.md:37
msgid "The canonical map is unique"
msgstr "典范映射是唯一的"

#: manual/design/core.md:39
msgid "For every ring `R` there is exactly one ring homomorphism `ℤ -> R`. A ring homomorphism `φ` must send `1` to `1`, and additivity then forces `φ(n) = 1 + ... + 1` (`n` times) for `n > 0` and `φ(-n) = -φ(n)`. Conversely, `n ↦ n·1` preserves `+` and `*` by distributivity. The same argument gives exactly one semiring homomorphism `ℕ -> R` for every semiring `R`. In categorical terms ℕ and ℤ are initial objects."
msgstr "对每个环 `R`，恰好存在一个环同态 `ℤ -> R`。环同态 `φ` 必须把 `1` 映到 `1`，加法性随即迫使 `n > 0` 时 `φ(n) = 1 + ... + 1`（`n` 个），且 `φ(-n) = -φ(n)`。反过来，由分配律，`n ↦ n·1` 保持 `+` 与 `*`。同样的论证说明，对每个半环 `R` 恰好存在一个半环同态 `ℕ -> R`。用范畴论的话说，ℕ 与 ℤ 是始对象。"

#: manual/design/core.md:46
msgid "Because the map depends only on `R`, it is a property of the target and fits a single-parameter trait: `FromNat::from_natural` and `FromInteger::from_integer`."
msgstr "由于这个映射只依赖于 `R`，它是目标类型的性质，适合用单参数 trait 表达：`FromNat::from_natural` 与 `FromInteger::from_integer`。"

#: manual/design/core.md:50
msgid "Fixed-width integers"
msgstr "定宽整数"

#: manual/design/core.md:52
msgid "`Int` adds and multiplies modulo 2^32, so as a ring it is ℤ/2^32. Its `from_integer` is the reduction `ℤ -> ℤ/2^32`, which is surjective. `normalize` goes the other way and picks one integer in every residue class, the one in `[-2^31, 2^31)`. The law `from_integer(normalize(x)) == x` says exactly that `normalize` is a section of the reduction:"
msgstr "`Int` 的加法与乘法按模 2^32 计算，因此作为环它是 ℤ/2^32。它的 `from_integer` 是满射的约化 `ℤ -> ℤ/2^32`。`normalize` 方向相反，在每个剩余类中选出一个整数，即位于 `[-2^31, 2^31)` 中的那个。定律 `from_integer(normalize(x)) == x` 恰好说明 `normalize` 是约化的截面："

#: manual/design/core.md:58
msgid "`normalize` is injective, because it has a left inverse."
msgstr "`normalize` 是单射，因为它有左逆。"

#: manual/design/core.md:59
msgid "Its image contains exactly one element of every class: at most one because it is injective, and at least one because of the law."
msgstr "它的像在每个类中恰好含一个元素：至多一个是因为它是单射，至少一个是因为定律。"

#: manual/design/core.md:61
msgid "It is not a homomorphism: `normalize(2147483647 + 1) = -2^31`, while `normalize(2147483647) + normalize(1) = 2^31`."
msgstr "它不是同态：`normalize(2147483647 + 1) = -2^31`，而 `normalize(2147483647) + normalize(1) = 2^31`。"

#: manual/design/core.md:64
msgid "The [hom design](hom.md) shows what a section does preserve."
msgstr "[hom 设计](hom.md)说明了截面究竟保持什么。"

#: manual/design/core.md:66
msgid "When a conversion is a homomorphism"
msgstr "何时转换是同态"

#: manual/design/core.md:68
msgid "`lift_to : S -> R` is `R::from_integer` composed with `S::normalize`. When `S` is ℤ/m (with `m = 0` for `BigInt`), a ring homomorphism `ℤ/m -> R` exists if and only if `m·1 = 0` in `R`:"
msgstr "`lift_to : S -> R` 是 `R::from_integer` 与 `S::normalize` 的复合。当 `S` 是 ℤ/m（`BigInt` 对应 `m = 0`）时，环同态 `ℤ/m -> R` 存在当且仅当在 `R` 中 `m·1 = 0`："

#: manual/design/core.md:72
msgid "If `ψ` is one, then `0 = ψ(0) = ψ(m·1) = m·1` in `R`."
msgstr "若 `ψ` 是这样的同态，则在 `R` 中 `0 = ψ(0) = ψ(m·1) = m·1`。"

#: manual/design/core.md:73
msgid "If `m·1 = 0`, the canonical map `ℤ -> R` sends `mℤ` to `0` and so factors through ℤ/m. It is unique because `ℤ -> ℤ/m` is surjective."
msgstr "若 `m·1 = 0`，典范映射 `ℤ -> R` 把 `mℤ` 映到 `0`，因此经由 ℤ/m 分解。由于 `ℤ -> ℤ/m` 是满射，这个分解是唯一的。"

#: manual/design/core.md:76
msgid "In that case `lift_to` is this homomorphism: write the canonical map `ℤ -> R` as `ψ ∘ π` with `π : ℤ -> ℤ/m`; then `lift_to = ψ ∘ π ∘ normalize = ψ`. So:"
msgstr "此时 `lift_to` 就是这个同态：把典范映射 `ℤ -> R` 写成 `ψ ∘ π`，其中 `π : ℤ -> ℤ/m`；则 `lift_to = ψ ∘ π ∘ normalize = ψ`。于是："

#: manual/design/core.md:80
msgid "`Int64 -> Int` is a homomorphism, because `2^64 ≡ 0 (mod 2^32)`."
msgstr "`Int64 -> Int` 是同态，因为 `2^64 ≡ 0 (mod 2^32)`。"

#: manual/design/core.md:81
msgid "`Int -> Int64` is not, because `2^32 ≢ 0 (mod 2^64)`."
msgstr "`Int -> Int64` 不是，因为 `2^32 ≢ 0 (mod 2^64)`。"

#: manual/design/core.md:82
msgid "No fixed-width integer maps homomorphically into `BigInt`, `Float` or `Double`, where `m·1 ≠ 0` for every `m > 0`."
msgstr "没有任何定宽整数能同态地映入 `BigInt`、`Float` 或 `Double`，因为在这些类型中对每个 `m > 0` 都有 `m·1 ≠ 0`。"

#: manual/design/core.md:85
msgid "Why the traits do not refer to each other"
msgstr "为什么这些 trait 不互相引用"

#: manual/design/core.md:87
msgid "Every conversion factors through ℤ: `S -> ℤ -> R`. The first half depends only on `S` (`Integral`), the second only on `R` (`FromInteger`), so neither trait has to relate two types. `FromInteger` takes a `BigInt` rather than a generic integral source, which lets `Integral` extend it without a cycle."
msgstr "每个转换都经由 ℤ 分解：`S -> ℤ -> R`。前半只依赖 `S`（`Integral`），后半只依赖 `R`（`FromInteger`），所以没有哪个 trait 需要关联两个类型。`FromInteger` 接收 `BigInt` 而不是泛型的整数源，这使 `Integral` 可以扩展它而不形成环。"

#: manual/design/core.md:92
#: manual/design/hom.md:105
msgid "Boundaries"
msgstr "边界"

#: manual/design/core.md:94
msgid "This package does not define matrices, complex numbers, polynomials, parsing, or numerical algorithms."
msgstr "本包不定义矩阵、复数、多项式、解析函数或数值算法。"

#: manual/design/core.md:96
msgid "It does not erase the semantic difference between exact and approximate number systems."
msgstr "它不会刻意抹平精确数值系统与近似数值系统之间的语义差异。"

#: manual/design/hom.md:1
msgid "hom design"
msgstr "hom 设计"

#: manual/design/hom.md:3
msgid "Goals"
msgstr "设计目标"

#: manual/design/hom.md:5
msgid "Express structure-preserving maps within MoonBit's current type system, hand the laws the type system cannot prove to the developer, and keep those obligations auditable and testable."
msgstr "在 MoonBit 现有类型系统里表达\"保持结构的映射\"，并把无法由类型系统证明的同态律交给开发者，同时让这些义务可审计、可测试。"

#: manual/design/hom.md:9
msgid "Constraints"
msgstr "约束"

#: manual/design/hom.md:11
msgid "MoonBit traits only have the `Self` parameter: there are no multi-parameter traits and no associated types, so a homomorphism `A -> B` cannot be a trait."
msgstr "MoonBit 的 trait 只有 `Self` 一个参数，没有多参 trait 和关联类型，因此 `A -> B` 的同态不能写成 trait。"

#: manual/design/hom.md:13
msgid "Homomorphisms out of ℕ and ℤ are unique (initial objects), which is why `FromNat` and `FromInteger` can live as target-side traits. Other homomorphisms are generally not unique and must be values."
msgstr "从 ℕ、ℤ 出发的同态是唯一的（始对象），所以 `FromNat` 与 `FromInteger` 可以作为目标侧 trait 存在。其他同态一般不唯一，必须作为值存在。"

#: manual/design/hom.md:17
msgid "Core decisions"
msgstr "核心设计决策"

#: manual/design/hom.md:19
msgid "LCF-style certificates: `Hom[S, A, B]` has private fields and is only constructed inside this package."
msgstr "LCF 风格的证书：`Hom[S, A, B]` 字段私有，只能由本包构造。"

#: manual/design/hom.md:21
msgid "The only public trust entry is `Hom::postulate`. Kernel rules use the package-private `trust`, so searching for `postulate` lists exactly the user-level obligations. (`assume` is a reserved word in MoonBit, hence the name.) `Section::postulate` is the trust entry for sections, and the canonical `Hom::from_integer` and `Section::of_integral` are the other leaves: their obligation sits on the trait instances."
msgstr "唯一的公开信任入口是 `Hom::postulate`。内核规则使用包内私有的 `trust`，所以搜索 `postulate` 得到的正好是全部用户层义务。（`assume` 是 MoonBit 的保留字，因此不用这个名字。）`Section::postulate` 是截面的信任入口，典范的 `Hom::from_integer` 与 `Section::of_integral` 是另外的叶子：它们的义务落在 trait 实例上。"

#: manual/design/hom.md:27
msgid "A lift from a quotient back to its cover is a `Section`, not a `Hom`. It carries the projection as a `Hom` and only promises `proj(lift(q)) == q`; agreement with the operations on representatives follows from that law. Keeping the two apart stops a representative lift, such as `Int -> BigInt`, from being composed as if it were a homomorphism."
msgstr "从商提升回覆盖代数的映射是 `Section` 而不是 `Hom`。它把投影作为 `Hom` 携带，只承诺 `proj(lift(q)) == q`；在代表元上与运算一致这一点由该定律推出。把两者分开，可以防止 `Int -> BigInt` 这类代表元提升被当作同态来复合。"

#: manual/design/hom.md:32
msgid "The signature is a phantom type `S` on the certificate, while the algebra is passed as a dictionary value `Algebra[S, A]`: the certificate says what is preserved, the dictionary is used for checking."
msgstr "签名以幽灵类型 `S` 出现在类型上，代数以字典 `Algebra[S, A]` 的形式作为值传递，两者分离：证书说明\"保持什么\"，字典用于检查。"

#: manual/design/hom.md:35
msgid "Signature inclusions are `Reduct[S, T]` witnesses only this package can build."
msgstr "签名之间的包含关系用只有本包能构造的 `Reduct[S, T]` 见证表示。"

#: manual/design/hom.md:36
msgid "The strength of preservation is the relation `rel` chosen at check time, so strict, lax and approximate homomorphisms share one API."
msgstr "保持强度由检查时的关系 `rel` 决定，严格、lax 与近似同态共用一套 API。"

#: manual/design/hom.md:41
msgid "The [hom tutorial](../tutorial/hom.md) uses `Section` without this mathematics."
msgstr "[hom 教程](../tutorial/hom.md)在不涉及这些数学的情况下使用 `Section`。"

#: manual/design/hom.md:44
msgid "Definition"
msgstr "定义"

#: manual/design/hom.md:46
msgid "Let `π : A -> Q` be a surjective homomorphism, for example the reduction `BigInt -> Int`. A section is a map `s : Q -> A` with `π(s(q)) = q` for every `q`: it picks one element of every class `π⁻¹(q)`. By the first isomorphism theorem `Q` is the quotient `A / ker π`, so a section is a choice of representatives for a quotient algebra."
msgstr "设 `π : A -> Q` 是满同态，例如约化 `BigInt -> Int`。截面是满足对每个 `q` 都有 `π(s(q)) = q` 的映射 `s : Q -> A`：它从每个类 `π⁻¹(q)` 中选出一个元素。由第一同构定理，`Q` 就是商 `A / ker π`，所以截面就是为商代数选取代表元。"

#: manual/design/hom.md:52
msgid "What a section preserves"
msgstr "截面保持什么"

#: manual/design/hom.md:54
msgid "For every operation `ω` and arguments `x`:"
msgstr "对每个运算 `ω` 与参数 `x`："

#: manual/design/hom.md:56
msgid "`s(ω(x))` and `ω(s(x))` are congruent modulo `ker π`. Apply `π` to both: `π(s(ω(x))) = ω(x)` by the section law, and `π(ω(s(x))) = ω(π(s(x))) = ω(x)` because `π` is a homomorphism."
msgstr "`s(ω(x))` 与 `ω(s(x))` 模 `ker π` 同余。对两者作用 `π`：由截面律 `π(s(ω(x))) = ω(x)`；由于 `π` 是同态，`π(ω(s(x))) = ω(π(s(x))) = ω(x)`。"

#: manual/design/hom.md:59
msgid "`s(ω(x)) = ω(s(x))` exactly when `ω(s(x))` lies in the image of `s`. If `ω(s(x)) = s(y)`, then `y = π(s(y)) = π(ω(s(x))) = ω(x)` by the same computation, so `ω(s(x)) = s(ω(x))`. Conversely `s(ω(x))` is always in the image."
msgstr "`s(ω(x)) = ω(s(x))` 当且仅当 `ω(s(x))` 位于 `s` 的像中。若 `ω(s(x)) = s(y)`，则由同样的计算 `y = π(s(y)) = π(ω(s(x))) = ω(x)`，所以 `ω(s(x)) = s(ω(x))`。反过来，`s(ω(x))` 总在像中。"

#: manual/design/hom.md:64
msgid "So `Section::check` only tests the section law; `check_ops` tests that `π` is a homomorphism on lifted arguments, and point 2 follows. For `Int`, the image of `s` is `[-2^31, 2^31)`, and \"the result is in the image\" means \"the result did not wrap around\"."
msgstr "因此 `Section::check` 只检验截面律；`check_ops` 检验 `π` 在提升后的参数上是同态，第 2 点随之成立。对 `Int` 而言，`s` 的像是 `[-2^31, 2^31)`，“结果在像中”就是“结果没有回绕”。"

#: manual/design/hom.md:69
msgid "The carry"
msgstr "进位"

#: manual/design/hom.md:71
msgid "For addition on `Int` the difference in point 1 is `s(a) + s(b) - s(a + b) = c(a, b)·2^32` with `c(a, b) ∈ {-1, 0, 1}`, the carry. Expanding `s(a) + s(b) + s(e)` in two ways gives"
msgstr "对 `Int` 的加法，第 1 点中的差为 `s(a) + s(b) - s(a + b) = c(a, b)·2^32`，其中 `c(a, b) ∈ {-1, 0, 1}`，即进位。把 `s(a) + s(b) + s(e)` 按两种方式展开得到"

#: manual/design/hom.md:79
msgid "so `c` is a 2-cocycle describing ℤ as an extension of ℤ/2^32 by 2^32ℤ. That extension does not split, because ℤ has no element of finite order, so no choice of representatives makes `s` a homomorphism. For multiplication the difference is the high word of the product."
msgstr "所以 `c` 是一个 2-余循环，它把 ℤ 描述为 ℤ/2^32 被 2^32ℤ 的扩张。由于 ℤ 没有有限阶元素，这个扩张不可分裂，因此无论怎样选取代表元，`s` 都不会成为同态。对乘法，这个差是乘积的高位字。"

#: manual/design/hom.md:84
msgid "Normal forms"
msgstr "范式"

#: manual/design/hom.md:86
msgid "`n = s ∘ π : A -> A` is a normal form: `n(n(a)) = n(a)`, `a` and `n(a)` are congruent, and `a`, `b` are congruent exactly when `n(a) = n(b)`. The quotient operations are computed on representatives as `s(ω_Q(x)) = n(ω_A(s(x)))`: compute in `A`, then normalize. Wrapped `Int` arithmetic is this computation for `A = ℤ`. Because `Section::normalize` is built from `s` and `π`, it cannot give two congruent values different normal forms."
msgstr "`n = s ∘ π : A -> A` 是一个范式：`n(n(a)) = n(a)`，`a` 与 `n(a)` 同余，且 `a`、`b` 同余当且仅当 `n(a) = n(b)`。商上的运算在代表元上按 `s(ω_Q(x)) = n(ω_A(s(x)))` 计算：先在 `A` 中计算，再化为范式。回绕的 `Int` 运算正是 `A = ℤ` 时的这种计算。由于 `Section::normalize` 由 `s` 与 `π` 构造，它不可能给两个同余的值不同的范式。"

#: manual/design/hom.md:94
msgid "Why `Section` is not a `Hom`"
msgstr "为什么 `Section` 不是 `Hom`"

#: manual/design/hom.md:96
msgid "A section is injective and agrees with the operations on its image, so it is easy to mistake for a homomorphism and compose it as one. Keeping it in a separate certificate makes the difference visible in the types: `Section` carries `π` as a `Hom`, and only promises `π(s(q)) = q`."
msgstr "截面是单射，并且在它的像上与运算一致，所以很容易被误认为同态并按同态来复合。把它放在单独的证书里，就能在类型上看出区别：`Section` 把 `π` 作为 `Hom` 携带，只承诺 `π(s(q)) = q`。"

#: manual/design/hom.md:101
msgid "The law does not fix which representatives are chosen. `[0, 2^32)` and `[-2^31, 2^31)` both give sections of `BigInt -> Int`; only the second preserves the signed order of `Int`. Such properties need their own checks."
msgstr "定律并不规定选哪些代表元。`[0, 2^32)` 与 `[-2^31, 2^31)` 都给出 `BigInt -> Int` 的截面，只有后者保持 `Int` 的有符号序。这类性质需要单独检验。"

#: manual/design/hom.md:107
msgid "Only single-sorted signatures. Multi-sorted structures such as modules (scalars plus vectors) are out of scope for this subsystem."
msgstr "只覆盖单类别签名。模这类多类别结构（标量加向量）不在本子系统内。"

#: manual/design/hom.md:109
msgid "Without higher-kinded types, functorial lifts (polynomials, matrices, ...) belong to their own packages and are not generalized here."
msgstr "没有 HKT，因此函子提升（多项式、矩阵等）由各自的包提供，不在本包内泛化。"

#: manual/design/hom.md:111
msgid "Laws are tested, not proven. The certificate guarantees traceable origin, not that the laws hold."
msgstr "同态律不被证明，只被测试。证书保证的是\"来源可追溯\"，不是\"定律成立\"。"

#: manual/design/hom.md:113
msgid "Soundness of `then` relies on one `S`-algebra per carrier. Built-in tags get this from trait coherence; dictionaries from `Algebra::make` only by convention."
msgstr "`then` 的可靠性依赖于每个载体上只有一个 `S`-代数。内置标签由 trait 的一致性保证这一点；`Algebra::make` 构造的字典只能靠约定。"

#: manual/design/hom.md:116
msgid "The certificate does not record the relation used by `check_by`, so lax and approximate maps compose as if they were strict."
msgstr "证书不记录 `check_by` 所用的关系，因此松弛映射与近似映射会被当作严格同态来复合。"

#: manual/design/hom.md:118
msgid "Fixed-width integers are ℤ/2^k, not ℤ or ℕ. Maps out of them into ℤ are sections, so they agree with the operations only while arithmetic does not wrap."
msgstr "定宽整数是 ℤ/2^k，不是 ℤ 或 ℕ。从它们到 ℤ 的映射是截面，所以只在运算不回绕时与运算一致。"

#: manual/design/hom.md:121
msgid "The section law does not fix which representatives are chosen, so properties such as order preservation need their own checks."
msgstr "截面律不规定选哪些代表元，因此保序之类的性质需要单独检验。"

#: manual/index.md:1
msgid "luna-generic"
msgstr "luna-generic"

#: manual/index.md:3
msgid "This manual documents the intended `v0.4.0` release of `Luna-Flow/luna-generic`."
msgstr "本手册记录 `Luna-Flow/luna-generic` 计划中的 `v0.4.0` 版本。"

#: manual/index.md:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概览"

#: manual/index.md:7
msgid "`luna-generic` provides general algebraic traits and default numeric instances for Luna projects."
msgstr "`luna-generic` 为 Luna 项目提供通用代数 trait 与默认数值类型实例。"

#: manual/index.md:9
msgid "The current release candidate centers on three changes:"
msgstr "当前版本的重点有三项："

#: manual/index.md:11
msgid "`FromNat` and `FromInteger` describe the unique homomorphisms out of ℕ and ℤ as target-side traits."
msgstr "`FromNat` 与 `FromInteger` 以目标侧 trait 的形式描述从 ℕ、ℤ 出发的唯一同态。"

#: manual/index.md:12
msgid "`Integral` is ℤ or a quotient ℤ/2^k, and `normalize` must be a section of its canonical map."
msgstr "`Integral` 是 ℤ 或其商 ℤ/2^k，`normalize` 必须是其典范映射的截面。"

#: manual/index.md:13
msgid "`lift_to` and `Section` keep the choice of a representative apart from homomorphisms."
msgstr "`lift_to` 与 `Section` 把“选取代表元”与同态区分开。"

#: manual/index.md:15
msgid "Exported traits"
msgstr "导出 Trait"

#: manual/index.md:25
msgid "Exported operations and default types"
msgstr "导出操作与默认类型"

#: manual/index.md:27
msgid "Operations: `One`, `Zero`, `Inverse`, `Conjugate`"
msgstr "操作 trait: `One`, `Zero`, `Inverse`, `Conjugate`"

#: manual/index.md:28
msgid "Default numeric types: `Int`, `Int16`, `Int64`, `UInt`, `UInt16`, `UInt64`, `BigInt`, `Float`, `Double`"
msgstr "默认数值类型: `Int`, `Int16`, `Int64`, `UInt`, `UInt16`, `UInt64`, `BigInt`, `Float`, `Double`"

#: manual/index.md:30
msgid "Integer model"
msgstr "整数模型"

#: manual/index.md:32
msgid "`Integral` covers signed integers, unsigned integers, and `BigInt`"
msgstr "`Integral` 覆盖有符号整数、无符号整数以及 `BigInt`"

#: manual/index.md:33
msgid "`Nat` covers the integral types with non-negative representatives: `UInt`, `UInt16`, and `UInt64`"
msgstr "`Nat` 涵盖代表元非负的整数类型：`UInt`、`UInt16` 与 `UInt64`"

#: manual/index.md:34
msgid "Fixed-width integers are ℤ/2^k; `FromInteger::from_integer` reduces modulo 2^k"
msgstr "定宽整数是 ℤ/2^k；`FromInteger::from_integer` 按模 2^k 约化"

#: manual/index.md:35
msgid "`Integral::normalize` picks the representative of a value as a `BigInt`, and `from_integer(normalize(x)) == x`"
msgstr "`Integral::normalize` 以 `BigInt` 形式选出一个值的代表元，且 `from_integer(normalize(x)) == x`"

#: manual/index.md:36
msgid "Unsigned integer instances stop at `Semiring`"
msgstr "无符号整数实例只到 `Semiring`"

#: manual/index.md:40
msgid "`FromInteger::from_integer` is the canonical map out of ℤ: exact for `BigInt`, modular for fixed-width integers, rounded for `Float` and `Double`"
msgstr "`FromInteger::from_integer` 是从 ℤ 出发的典范映射：对 `BigInt` 精确，对定宽整数取模，对 `Float` 与 `Double` 舍入"

#: manual/index.md:41
msgid "`lift_to(x)` lifts to the representative and maps it into the target; it is a function, not a homomorphism"
msgstr "`lift_to(x)` 提升到代表元后映入目标；它是函数，不是同态"

#: manual/index.md:42
msgid "`NatHomomorphism::from_nat` and `IntegralHomomorphism::from_integral` are deprecated in favour of `FromNat`, `FromInteger` and `lift_to`"
msgstr "`NatHomomorphism::from_nat` 与 `IntegralHomomorphism::from_integral` 已废弃，请改用 `FromNat`、`FromInteger` 与 `lift_to`"

#: manual/index.md:44
msgid "Generalized homomorphisms"
msgstr "广义同态"

#: manual/index.md:46
msgid "`Hom[S, A, B]`: a certificate for maps preserving the signature `S`, built only through `Hom::postulate` (which creates a proof obligation), the canonical map `Hom::from_integer`, or inference rules"
msgstr "`Hom[S, A, B]`：保持签名 `S` 的映射证书，只能经由 `Hom::postulate`（产生证明义务）、典范映射 `Hom::from_integer` 或推理规则构造"

#: manual/index.md:47
msgid "`Section[S, Q, A]`: a certificate that a lift picks one representative per class of a quotient; `Section::of_integral` is the canonical one for integral types"
msgstr "`Section[S, Q, A]`：证明一个提升从商的每个类中恰好选出一个代表元的证书；`Section::of_integral` 是整数类型的典范截面"

#: manual/index.md:48
msgid "Signature tags: `AddMonoidSig`, `MulMonoidSig`, `AddGroupSig`, `SemiringSig`, `RingSig`"
msgstr "签名标签：`AddMonoidSig`、`MulMonoidSig`、`AddGroupSig`、`SemiringSig`、`RingSig`"

#: manual/index.md:49
msgid "Algebra dictionaries `Algebra[S, A]`, operations `Op[A]`, the product type `Prod[A, B]` and reduct witnesses `Reduct[S, T]`"
msgstr "代数字典 `Algebra[S, A]`、运算 `Op[A]`、积类型 `Prod[A, B]`、约化见证 `Reduct[S, T]`"

#: manual/index.md:50
msgid "`Hom::check` / `Hom::check_by` test the homomorphism laws on samples with strict, lax or approximate strength"
msgstr "`Hom::check` / `Hom::check_by` 以样本测试同态律，支持严格、lax 与近似三种强度"

#: manual/index.md:51
msgid "See the [hom API](api/hom.md), [tutorial](tutorial/hom.md) and [design](design/hom.md)"
msgstr "详见 [hom API](api/hom.md)、[教程](tutorial/hom.md)、[设计](design/hom.md)"

#: manual/index.md:53
msgid "Where to read next"
msgstr "接下来读什么"

#: manual/index.md:55
msgid "The [core tutorial](tutorial/core.md) writes small generic algorithms against these traits. The [core API](api/core.md) lists every exported trait and instance, and the [core design](design/core.md) explains why the hierarchy and the conversions are shaped this way."
msgstr "[core 教程](tutorial/core.md)基于这些 trait 编写小型泛型算法；[core API](api/core.md)列出所有导出的 trait 与实例；[core 设计](design/core.md)说明层级与转换为何如此设计。"

#: manual/index.md:57
msgid "Validation"
msgstr "校验"

#: manual/index.md:59
msgid "Recommended release checks:"
msgstr "建议的发布前检查："

